&lt;p&gt;Join us for a movie:&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Water For Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;which explores the collision of water rights, Indigenous beliefs, and resource extraction through the lives of three Latin American community leaders.&amp;nbsp;The right to clean water is a global issue&amp;mdash;in Latin America it has become a matter of life and death.&lt;/p&gt;
