&lt;p&gt;Originally advertised as &amp;ldquo;The Greatest Airplane Mystery Thriller Ever Produced,&amp;rdquo; &lt;em&gt;The Flying Ace&lt;/em&gt; is a testament to the enduring cultural significance of silent-era race films. The film will be presented with live accompaniment by internationally-acclaimed DJ Parl&amp;eacute;, whose eclectic music style will span the century since the film&amp;rsquo;s release, bringing The Flying Ace into the here and now.&lt;/p&gt;
